{"seq":1,"slug":"memory-architecture","title":"记忆架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/claude-code-architecture/memory-system/memory-architecture","wordCount":1384,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"记忆架构\">记忆架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Claude Code 的记忆采用<strong>纯文件方案</strong>：所有记忆以 Markdown 持久化在 <code>~/.claude/projects/&lt;project&gt;/memory/</code> 下，不依赖数据库，用户可用任意编辑器查看与修改。文件顶部用 <strong>YAML frontmatter</strong> 存元数据，正文即记忆内容。</p>\n<p>记忆按类型分为四类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>user</code></td>\n<td>用户画像与偏好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>feedback</code></td>\n<td>用户给过的反馈与纠正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>project</code></td>\n<td>项目级事实与约定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reference</code></td>\n<td>可复用的参考资料</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type MemoryType = &#39;user&#39; | &#39;feedback&#39; | &#39;project&#39; | &#39;reference&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'user'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'feedback'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'project'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reference'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>所有记忆经 <code>MEMORY.md</code> 作为入口点汇总，再由 <code>buildMemoryPrompt</code> 组装、<code>loadMemoryPrompt</code> 按策略分发；「文件即真相」意味着记忆的可读性与可迁移性都是设计的直接产物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文件系统存储模型\">文件系统存储模型</h2><p>Claude Code 的记忆系统采用纯文件方案，所有记忆持久化为 Markdown 文件，存储在项目级目录 <code>~/.claude/projects/&lt;project&gt;/memory/</code> 下。这种设计避免了数据库依赖，用户可以直接用任意文本编辑器查看和修改记忆内容。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MemoryFileMetadata {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  type: MemoryType;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type MemoryType = &#39;user&#39; | &#39;feedback&#39; | &#39;project&#39; | &#39;reference&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface MemoryFile {&#10;  frontmatter: MemoryFileMetadata;&#10;  content: string;&#10;  filePath: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryFileMetadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'user'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'feedback'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'project'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reference'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  frontmatter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryFileMetadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  filePath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>目录结构遵循约定优于配置的原则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"~/.claude/&#10;├── projects/&#10;│   └── &lt;project-hash&gt;/&#10;│       └── memory/&#10;│           ├── MEMORY.md          # 入口点文件&#10;│           ├── preferences.md     # 用户偏好&#10;│           ├── corrections.md     # 反馈修正&#10;│           └── team/              # 团队共享记忆&#10;│               └── conventions.md\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>~/.claude/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── projects/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── &#x3C;project-hash>/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── memory/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           ├── MEMORY.md          # 入口点文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           ├── preferences.md     # 用户偏好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           ├── corrections.md     # 反馈修正</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           └── team/              # 团队共享记忆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│               └── conventions.md</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径组成部分</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>~/.claude/</code></td>\n<td>全局配置目录</td>\n<td>所有项目共享的根目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>projects/</code></td>\n<td>固定目录名</td>\n<td>项目级记忆隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;project-hash&gt;</code></td>\n<td>项目路径哈希</td>\n<td>避免路径冲突和特殊字符问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>memory/</code></td>\n<td>固定目录名</td>\n<td>记忆文件存放位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>team/</code></td>\n<td>可选子目录</td>\n<td>团队共享记忆，受额外安全限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 项目哈希基于项目根路径生成，因此同一项目在不同机器上可能有不同的哈希值。迁移记忆时需要注意路径映射。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"四类记忆分类法\">四类记忆分类法</h2><p>每个记忆文件通过 YAML frontmatter 中的 <code>type</code> 字段标识其分类。四种类型覆盖了 AI 编码助手在长期交互中需要记住的所有知识维度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"---&#10;name: coding-style&#10;description: User&#39;s preferred coding conventions&#10;type: user&#10;---&#10;# 编码风格偏好&#10;&#10;- 使用函数式风格，避免 class&#10;- 优先使用 const 声明&#10;- 缩进使用 2 空格\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">coding-style</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">User's preferred coding conventions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编码风格偏好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">使用函数式风格，避免 class</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">优先使用 const 声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">缩进使用 2 空格</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    MEM[记忆分类] --&gt; USER[&quot;user&lt;br/&gt;用户偏好&quot;]&#10;    MEM --&gt; FEED[&quot;feedback&lt;br/&gt;反馈修正&quot;]&#10;    MEM --&gt; PROJ[&quot;project&lt;br/&gt;项目上下文&quot;]&#10;    MEM --&gt; REF[&quot;reference&lt;br/&gt;外部知识&quot;]&#10;&#10;    USER --&gt; U1[&quot;编码风格&quot;]&#10;    USER --&gt; U2[&quot;工具偏好&quot;]&#10;    FEED --&gt; F1[&quot;错误修正&quot;]&#10;    FEED --&gt; F2[&quot;行为调整&quot;]&#10;    PROJ --&gt; P1[&quot;架构说明&quot;]&#10;    PROJ --&gt; P2[&quot;依赖关系&quot;]&#10;    REF --&gt; R1[&quot;API 文档&quot;]&#10;    REF --&gt; R2[&quot;规范引用&quot;]\">graph TD\n    MEM[记忆分类] --&gt; USER[\"user&lt;br/&gt;用户偏好\"]\n    MEM --&gt; FEED[\"feedback&lt;br/&gt;反馈修正\"]\n    MEM --&gt; PROJ[\"project&lt;br/&gt;项目上下文\"]\n    MEM --&gt; REF[\"reference&lt;br/&gt;外部知识\"]\n\n    USER --&gt; U1[\"编码风格\"]\n    USER --&gt; U2[\"工具偏好\"]\n    FEED --&gt; F1[\"错误修正\"]\n    FEED --&gt; F2[\"行为调整\"]\n    PROJ --&gt; P1[\"架构说明\"]\n    PROJ --&gt; P2[\"依赖关系\"]\n    REF --&gt; R1[\"API 文档\"]\n    REF --&gt; R2[\"规范引用\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>典型内容</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>user</code></td>\n<td>用户个人偏好</td>\n<td>编码风格、工具链选择、语言偏好</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>feedback</code></td>\n<td>AI 行为修正</td>\n<td>错误修正记录、行为调整指令</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>project</code></td>\n<td>项目级上下文</td>\n<td>架构说明、目录结构、构建流程</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reference</code></td>\n<td>外部参考知识</td>\n<td>API 文档摘要、规范引用</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每种类型在 prompt 构建时有不同的权重和呈现方式。<code>user</code> 类型的记忆会被优先注入到系统 prompt 中，因为用户偏好直接影响输出质量。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"yaml-frontmatter-元数据\">YAML Frontmatter 元数据</h2><p>每个记忆文件以标准 YAML frontmatter 开头，包含三个必需字段。解析器在加载时会验证这些字段的存在性和类型正确性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function parseMemoryFile(filePath: string): MemoryFile | null {&#10;  const content = readFileSync(filePath, &#39;utf-8&#39;);&#10;  const match = content.match(/^---\\n([\\s\\S]*?)\\n---\\n([\\s\\S]*)$/);&#10;&#10;  if (!match) return null;&#10;&#10;  const frontmatter = parseYaml(match[1]) as MemoryFileMetadata;&#10;&#10;  if (!frontmatter.name || !frontmatter.type) return null;&#10;&#10;  const validTypes: MemoryType[] = [&#39;user&#39;, &#39;feedback&#39;, &#39;project&#39;, &#39;reference&#39;];&#10;  if (!validTypes.includes(frontmatter.type)) return null;&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    frontmatter,&#10;    content: match[2].trim(),&#10;    filePath,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseMemoryFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">filePath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryFile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readFileSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filePath, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'utf-8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D